{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-38","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle be added together, the whole is irrational; and let it be called a second bimedial straight line.","book":10,"number":38,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.38","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.38/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":38,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","contentId":"euclid-10-38","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3846586e9571ae2587b9e207dbe4078519d085e2704b567d779e07f6da62ab4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-38.statement","euclid-10-38.construction.1","euclid-10-38.construction.2","euclid-10-38.proof.1","euclid-10-38.proof.2","euclid-10-38.proof.3","euclid-10-38.proof.4","euclid-10-38.proof.5","euclid-10-38.proof.6","euclid-10-38.proof.7","euclid-10-38.proof.8","euclid-10-38.proof.9","euclid-10-38.proof.10","euclid-10-38.proof.11","euclid-10-38.proof.12","euclid-10-38.proof.13","euclid-10-38.conclusion","euclid-10-38.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-38.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fe97527a597ed88acfdaa4631725740b99113744f1567a2613aa8221f137028","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle be added together, the whole is irrational; and let it be called a second bimedial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将两个中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度和中项无理线段 矩形加在一起,则整条线为无理;并称之为第二条双中项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78fd121f8ba0de2738f8447d790c8e9dd31e3b1446ad3c216a603914eb022f8d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two medial straight lines AB, BC commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle be added together; I say that AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将2 中项无理线段 AB BC 平方可公度而长度不可公度 和中项无理线段 矩形 相加;我说AC 等于 无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f80ad91b2acb4dd350aa35ea045cb445ea0e02edd3b26224a0eaa1d7c9fbc3e0","citations":["euclid-1-44"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line DE be set out, and let the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AC be applied to DE, producing DG as breadth. [[I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 DE设定为有理线段 DE,将AC等于正方形机适用于DE,将DG宽度扩大（相关点与线段：DF） [ [I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a4412f2c807e8fbc393164f53f3424c108cb9c6b1a845e1db7f9e05a287e6ff","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the square on AC is equal to the squares on AB, BC and twice the rectangle AB, BC, [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4) ] let EH, equal to the squares on AB, BC, be applied to DE; therefore the remainder HF is equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC的正方形等于AB的正方形,BC等于矩形的正方形,BC等于矩形的两倍,BC等于AB的BC,BC等于正方形,DE适用EH,其余HF等于矩形的两倍,AB,BC。 [ [II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aa2d8fb41cc271542a975babb4b6372cff3509bbe32a56146136832e7f378ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since each of the straight lines AB, BC is medial, therefore the squares on AB, BC are also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB线,BC线每条是中项无理线段线 所以AB线的正方形也是中项无理线段线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e4a8932aca67228c1ede0869157e29fe1e87a7839d3aeced840c7ec0c3c2f5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, twice the rectangle AB, BC is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但假设是 矩形 AB BC 两倍也是 中项无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5700268c1d896fd86c2d89c7958ad60f2860e2fda7d9412a52c302e5ca82a1fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EH is equal to the squares on AB, BC, while FH is equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC; therefore each of the rectangle EH, HF is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH等于AB,BC的正方形,FH等于矩形,AB,BC的两倍,矩形,EH的每1,HF等于中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10b0e933793071c4355b3a38bde5014ad02a5266a1c69db921cd88e38a9966b3","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore each of the straight lines DH, HG is rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,DH直线、HG直线和不可公度直线各长DE [ [X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ae834ec96c9d12dcbfa938b10d99786c529d26a8ac747e9105df369e64ffb22","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AB is incommensurable in length with BC, and, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AB to the rectangle AB, BC, therefore the square on AB is incommensurable with the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AB为不可公度,BC,AB与BC之比等于正方形,AB与矩形之比,BC与BC之比,BC即为不可公度,不可公度与矩形之比。] [ [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6954d65e750c8d1edcd44095b2fa39bcb6efa286abb11b3d42a1878c5c4ac59c","citations":["euclid-10-15","euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of the squares on AB, BC is commensurable with the square on AB, [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15) ] and twice the rectangle AB, BC is commensurable with the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB和BC的正方形和AB的可公度之和 和矩形和AB的两倍是可公度和矩形和BC的可公度之和 [ [ [X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15) [X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9c733b52ed47d1f7dcb44fd3ccbef4603d9a13e93ae15c2bd1a34a199387ac3","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sum of the squares on AB, BC is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB和BC的正方形和不可公度是不可公度,是矩形和BC的两倍 [ [X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30345940f1c05fc3203b2ad126d8f3d3e314dc69e9a6fc6fe1ef2035cf09312a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EH is equal to the squares on AB, BC, and HF is equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EH等于AB,AB,BC,HF等于矩形,AB的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2c4668aed491d0f2a61192f560281207c93d5596a7fe89b92975c824ae2fd8c","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EH is incommensurable with HF, so that DH is also incommensurable in length with HG. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) , [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EH是不可公度和HF,DH也是不可公度,HG [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e564d6d746446b8023d4cde9c785bb5f500da34c211d1e3589e4cb004db84433","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DH, HG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; so that DG is irrational. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DH,HG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;DG是无理 [ [X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bda61873e6936042a9b68637052e1e5aeb7563e49787a5ccc75e7a7ca37b5c1","citations":["euclid-10-20","euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DE is rational; and the rectangle contained by an irrational and a rational straight line is irrational; [cf. [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20) ] therefore the area DF is irrational, and the side of the square equal to it is irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DE是有理;矩形是由无理和有理线段组成的无理; 因此,DF是无理, 正方形的一方等于无理 [cf.  [ [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20) [X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c978e7bd8f6d56e33138d60add8c5bbdbf1743e9e6daedf8d6e5ce56009613d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AC is the side of the square equal to DF; therefore AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC是正方形等于DF的一面,因此AC是无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":16,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77aa7736aed6f8154cf9cc8678b048d47ce8faf5973fd9024193b06daf43c35d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called a second bimedial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"改成双中项无理线段直线 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-38.source","contentId":"euclid-10-38","revisionId":"euclid-10-38@raw-d3846586e9571ae2","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a133cc2a38916b74fb74da553f33e360f46ee441a22400d10bc42de5517f866","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"pr